> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Interface change**: [preprocess()](file:///c:/Users/marto/Documents/egyetem/szakdoga/szakdolgozat/model/preprocessing/preprocessor.py#16-102) now returns a **3-tuple** instead of 2-tuple.

```diff
- Returns:
